It is possible to use up to 4GB as you mentioned.
The usable memory modules are buffered JEDEC 21- C and PC100 standard 
SDRAM DIMM memory:
128  MB ECC Memory DIMMs (4x32MB)
256 MB ECC Memory DIMMs (4x64MB)
512 MB ECC Memory DIMMs (4x128MB)
1024 MB ECC Memory DIMMs (4x256MB - stacked)

Regards,

Kari



